                                        <a href="https://calendly.com/itdgrowthlabs-info/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="js-book-call" data-source="blog_cta" style="background:#1565c0;color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;">Book Free 30-min Call</a>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Is subscription mandatory for D2C skincare?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes for LTV compounding. 3-5x LTV lift vs one-time purchase. Brands without subscription miss 60-70% of achievable year-2 revenue. Bold + Recharge + Shopify Subscriptions from launch.</p>
                                        <h3>Which subscription app should we use?</h3>
                                        <p>Bold Subscriptions for most Growth-tier (Rs 5-25K/mo, deep customisation + flexible cadence). Recharge for Enterprise (Rs 8-30K/mo, advanced analytics + LTV cohort). Shopify Subscriptions if already on Shopify Plus.</p>
                                        <h3>What refill cadence should we set?</h3>
                                        <p>Serums 45-60 days. Moisturisers 60-90. Cleansers 60-90. Sunscreens 30-45 (higher summer usage). Toners 60-90. Shampoo 90-120. Face oils 60-90. Usage-based per SKU category.</p>
                                        <h3>What subscription discount should we offer?</h3>
                                        <p>15-25% discount vs one-time purchase. Higher discount (25-30%) for annual pre-pay. Loyalty programme + cross-sell + free gift also compound retention.</p>
                                        <h3>What is typical LTV for skincare subscription vs non-subscription?</h3>
                                        <p>One-time first order Rs 600-2,500. Non-subscription 12-month LTV 1.5-2.5x. Subscription 12-month LTV 3-5x. Subscription 24-month LTV 5-8x.</p>
                                        <h3>What are subscription retention benchmarks?</h3>
                                        <p>Month 3: 70-85% (top-quartile 80%+). Month 6: 55-75% (top-quartile 70%+). Month 12: 40-60% (top-quartile 55%+). Month 24: 25-40% (top-quartile 35%+).</p>
                                        <h3>What retention flows should we build?</h3>
                                        <p>Onboarding (welcome + routine + tutorial) + pre-shipment (48-hour reminder + skip / pause / edit) + post-shipment (usage check-in + review + concern questionnaire) + winback (cancellation survey + retention offer + 60-day reactivation).</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD GrowthLabs handle skincare subscription?</h3>
                                        <p>Bold + Recharge + Shopify Subscriptions setup + cadence design + retention flow production + WhatsApp integration (Interakt) + LTV + cohort reporting. See <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php">skincare vertical page</a>.</p>
